    {
      "id": "97138479-0706-4ac2-97eb-0194667bdd5a",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "Major Specific Criteria This articulation agreement displays lower-division course requirements specific to the major. Cal State LA lower-division course numbers range from 1000 - 2999. Students are advised to seek advisement from a counselor when planning to transfer to CSU Los Angeles and refer to the University Catalog to learn more about this major and its features. Additional admissions criteria for the major can be found on the Major Specific Criteria campus website. Please note that admissions requirements can vary by term so check back to see if there are any changes.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(169, 62, 58);\">Major Specific Criteria</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This articulation agreement displays lower-division course requirements specific to the major. Cal State LA lower-division course numbers range from 1000 - 2999. Students are advised to seek advisement from a counselor when planning to transfer to CSU Los Angeles and refer to the </span><a href=\"https://ecatalog.calstatela.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">University Catalog</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> to learn more about this major and its features. Additional admissions criteria for the major can be found on the </span><a href=\"https://www.calstatela.edu/admissions/major-specific-criteria\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Major Specific Criteria</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> campus website.</span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(43, 134, 24);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(137, 58, 171);\"><em>Please note that admissions requirements can vary by term so check back to see if there are any changes.&nbsp;</em></strong></p>"
    },
